-- Populate exercises.image_url with verified, name-matched photos from the
-- free-exercise-db dataset (Unlicense/public domain), served via jsDelivr CDN.
-- Only exercises with a confident name+equipment+muscle match are set; the rest
-- are left null rather than guess. No reliably-licensed gif_url/video_url source
-- exists for these exercises, so those columns are intentionally left untouched.

